// bootstrap: sparse_la — 稀疏线性代数: CSR/GMRES/CG

Point sparse_la:
  csr_matrix(rows, cols, data, indices, indptr) -> SparseMatrix
  gmres(A: SparseMatrix, b: Vector, m: int) -> Vector
  conjugate_gradient(A: SPD_Matrix, b: Vector) -> Vector

Constraint sparse_la:
  csr stores only nonzero entries
  gmres minimizes residual in Krylov subspace K_m
  conjugate_gradient converges for SPD matrices

Prove;
Normalize;
